WEBVTT

00:00:02.871 --> 00:00:05.040
I HAVE STRENGTH
ENOUGH FOR THIS.

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:26.670
HARRY POTTER,

00:00:26.713 --> 00:00:29.455
WE MEET AGAIN.

00:00:29.499 --> 00:00:31.153
VOLDEMORT?

00:00:31.196 --> 00:00:32.719
YES.

00:00:32.763 --> 00:00:35.331
YOU SEE
WHAT I'VE BECOME?

00:00:35.374 --> 00:00:39.248
SEE WHAT I MUST DO
TO SURVIVE?

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:41.337
LIVE OFF ANOTHER.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.469
A MERE PARASITE.

00:00:43.513 --> 00:00:47.430
UNICORN BLOOD
CAN SUSTAIN ME,

00:00:47.473 --> 00:00:51.390
BUT IT CANNOT GIVE ME
A BODY OF MY OWN,

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:54.306
BUT THERE IS
SOMETHING THAT CAN.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:58.049
SOMETHING THAT,
CONVENIENTLY ENOUGH,

00:00:58.093 --> 00:01:01.052
LIES IN YOUR POCKET.

00:01:01.096 --> 00:01:03.010
STOP HIM!

00:01:07.319 --> 00:01:11.149
DON'T BE A FOOL.

00:01:11.193 --> 00:01:13.760
WHY SUFFER
A HORRIFIC DEATH

00:01:13.804 --> 00:01:18.200
WHEN YOU CAN JOIN ME
AND LIVE?

00:01:18.243 --> 00:01:19.549
NEVER!

00:01:19.592 --> 00:01:23.509
[LAUGHS] BRAVERY.

00:01:23.553 --> 00:01:26.773
YOUR PARENTS
HAD IT, TOO.

00:01:26.817 --> 00:01:30.386
TELL ME, HARRY,

00:01:30.429 --> 00:01:31.865
WOULD YOU LIKE
TO SEE

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:34.520
YOUR MOTHER
AND FATHER AGAIN?

00:01:34.564 --> 00:01:39.612
TOGETHER, WE CAN
BRING THEM BACK.

00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:41.353
ALL I ASK

00:01:41.397 --> 00:01:43.790
IS FOR SOMETHING
IN RETURN.

00:01:51.146 --> 00:01:55.280
THAT'S IT, HARRY.

00:01:55.324 --> 00:01:59.371
THERE IS NO
GOOD AND EVIL.

00:01:59.415 --> 00:02:02.635
THERE IS ONLY POWER

00:02:02.679 --> 00:02:06.248
AND THOSE TOO WEAK
TO SEEK IT.

00:02:07.423 --> 00:02:12.645
TOGETHER, WE'LL DO
EXTRAORDINARY THINGS.

00:02:12.689 --> 00:02:15.344
JUST GIVE ME THE STONE!

00:02:17.694 --> 00:02:19.174
YOU LIAR!

00:02:19.217 --> 00:02:20.436
KILL HIM!

00:02:36.626 --> 00:02:38.062
AAH!

00:02:38.105 --> 00:02:42.806
AAAAAAAHHHH!

00:02:44.808 --> 00:02:46.462
WHAT IS THIS MAGIC?!

00:02:46.505 --> 00:02:48.855
FOOL!
GET THE STONE!

00:02:55.253 --> 00:02:59.605
AAAAAAAH!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.088
AAAAAHHHH!

00:03:48.132 --> 00:03:50.830
AAAHHHHH!

00:04:35.397 --> 00:04:36.436
GOOD AFTERNOON, HARRY.

